{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Brave New World of the Internet", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Call for Help", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Questions Within Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span><br/>Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/>Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Do you know how I can solve this technical problem? (question with sentence)", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Can you tell me where the router is located in your apartment? (asking for clarification)", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Discussing How to Deal With Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. It is particularly useful if you want to discuss a complicated technical problem.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " If you write an article about solving issues, you can use modals like <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> should</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to suggest solutions and offer assistance. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">I would ... </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I wouldn't ... </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">You could ... </span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You can also use  <span class=\"italic\">must</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">might want to</span>  or Imperatives to strongly suggest a solution.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">You might want to ... <br/> You must ...<br/> Always check ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are examples of a technical assistant giving suggestions about how to deal with technical problems. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It sounds like you might have a problem with your router.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You could try resetting the router.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should make sure all the lights are green.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If they aren't, I would switch  the router off and go back to the original factory preset.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Always make sure that your laptop is less than 20 feet away from the router.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "router", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device that forwards Internet data through a network", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't have Wi-Fi at home. I think I may have a problem with the router.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about technical problems.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take apart", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to disassemble, often used for electronic devices", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Should I take the router apart to see what the problem is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reception", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the quality of receiving electromagnetic communication", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The reception is better if you put your router in a central location.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "signal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an electrical impulse or electromagnetic wave you send or receive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Wi-Fi signal is very bad.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to reset", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to set again differently", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should try resetting the router.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "firmware", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of software embedded in a device", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the router doesn't work, it may be a firmware issue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hardware", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the physical elements of an electronic system", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If all the lights are off, then it's a hardware problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "factory preset", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the particular way an electronic device was set up before you used it for the first time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the router still doesn't work, go back to the factory preset.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (10 - 14 lines) about how to solve a common technical problem. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the words you learned  in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give advice to your partner on the steps to take to solve the issue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for clarification and for advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exchange roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about technology.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice on how to deal with technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification on technical issues.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification or use rhetorical questions to emphasize a point. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Are you curious about the way electronic devices work? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If a device or an appliance stopped working at home, would you be able to fix it by yourself? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Modern life can be problematic sometimes!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "s